"Examples are available at <a href=\"http://www.xs4all.nl/~ace/X-Faces/\">"
"http://www.xs4all.nl/~ace/X-Faces/</a>."
msgstr ""
"उदाहरण <a href=\"http://www.xs4all.nl/~ace/X-Faces/\">"
"http://www.xs4all.nl/~ace/X-Faces/</a> मा उपलब्ध छन् ।"

